Third-party components distributed in this package, with their license
texts under licenses/:

- archives/ -- the .NET runtime's native archives, built by Lamella from the
  dotnet/runtime source at the tag named in the class's identity file under
  tier/, Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors, MIT license: the
  text is licenses/dotnet-runtime-LICENSE.txt, and the runtime's own
  third-party notices are licenses/dotnet-runtime-THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.
- tier/*/rt-libc.o -- the C and math library closure the images link,
  merged from the newlib C library's members as distributed with the Arm GNU
  Toolchain; newlib is distributed under a collection of BSD-style licenses
  whose texts are licenses/newlib-COPYING.NEWLIB.txt.
- kernels/*/librhu_core.a -- the Rust standard library's core and
  compiler_builtins members the kernel archives of this class link against,
  as the pinned Rust toolchain ships them, distributed under the Rust
  project's terms: your choice of the MIT license or the Apache License,
  Version 2.0, the same terms as this package's own files.

The archives, the tier objects, the core archive and the license texts named
above are placed in the package when it is built; a source checkout carries
this notice and the project file alone.
